PipelineSetting.description:
Pipeline setting. The type of `value` depends on `name`:
* `currency` — string, currency code (e.g. `USD`);
* `color` — string, HEX color (e.g. `#4C9AFF`);
* `responsible` — non-empty array of unique user IDs (the account owner or their users); new deals created without a responsible are assigned to them in turn (round-robin), in the array order. More than one ID requires a paid tariff;
* `stepForNewPaymentDeal`, `stepForSuccessfulPaymentDeal`, `stepForFailedPaymentDeal` — integer step ID of this pipeline or `null`;
* `stepsForDisableAutomation` — array of step IDs of this pipeline;
* `paymentAutomation`, `expenses`, `singleDealPerPaymentLink` — boolean;
* `timeToFail` — integer number of hours (1, 2, 6, 12, 24 or 48) or `null`.

value.description:
Attribute value as a string:
* date — `Y-m-d H:i:s`, `Y-m-d H:i`, `Y/m/d H:i:s`, `Y/m/d H:i`, `Y.m.d H:i:s`, `Y.m.d H:i` (account time zone) or `Y-m-d\TH:i:s\Z` (UTC);
* checkbox — `0` or `1`;
* multiSelect — JSON array of attribute options, e.g. `["Option A","Option B"]`;
* other types — any text.
